WEBVTT

00:02:31.079 --> 00:02:36.996
Three months turn to six months. Summer
came. We're working all the time.

00:02:39.913 --> 00:02:44.121
And he turned to me after we
repaired the front porch

00:02:44.121 --> 00:02:46.913
and had finished 50 paned windows.

00:02:47.496 --> 00:02:49.871
And he was now in remission.

00:02:50.163 --> 00:02:53.788
And he said, you know, working
on this house saved my life.

00:02:58.121 --> 00:03:01.704
Were you surprised when he said that or
did you immediately know what he meant?